  "description": "Operation Flashpoint is a series of military simulation games. The first game, Operation Flashpoint, was developed by Bohemia Interactive Studio. The second games, comprising Operation Flashpoint: Dragon Rising and Operation Flashpoint: Red River, were developed by Codemasters.",
  "intro": "<table>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Operation Flashpoint Series</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Video_game_genres\" title=\"Video game genres\">Genres</a></th>\n<td><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Military_simulation\" title=\"Military simulation\">Military simulation</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tactical_shooter\" title=\"Tactical shooter\">tactical shooter</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Video_game_developer\" title=\"Video game developer\">Developers</a></th>\n<td><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bohemia_Interactive\" title=\"Bohemia Interactive\">Bohemia Interactive</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Codemasters\" title=\"Codemasters\">Codemasters</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Video_game_publisher\" title=\"Video game publisher\">Publishers</a></th>\n<td>Codemasters</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Platforms</th>\n<td><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Microsoft_Windows\" title=\"Microsoft Windows\">Microsoft Windows</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PlayStation_3\" title=\"PlayStation 3\">PlayStation 3</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xbox_(console)\" title=\"Xbox (console)\">Xbox</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xbox_360\" title=\"Xbox 360\">Xbox 360</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Year of inception</th>\n<td>2001</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n_**Operation Flashpoint**_ is a series of [military](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Military \"Military\") simulation games. The first game, Operation Flashpoint, was developed by [Bohemia Interactive Studio](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bohemia_Interactive_Studio \"Bohemia Interactive Studio\"). The second games, comprising Operation Flashpoint: Dragon Rising and Operation Flashpoint: Red River, were developed by [Codemasters](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Codemasters \"Codemasters\").",
