            "Bohemia Interactive series"
          ],
          "markdown": "Main article: [Operation Flashpoint: Cold War Crisis](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Flashpoint:_Cold_War_Crisis \"Operation Flashpoint: Cold War Crisis\")\n\n<i>Operation Flashpoint: Cold War Crisis'</i>s gameplay varies significantly depending on the player's role, but the game is best described as a [tactical shooter](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tactical_shooter \"Tactical shooter\") with significant vehicle elements and minor real-time tactics elements. Set in 1985, the game takes place on two fictional and one real-life islands: the island-states of Everon and Malden, and later in the game, on the barren Russian island of Kolgujev which is the staging point for the renegade Russian forces invading Everon and Malden.",
