        {
          "title": "Operation Flashpoint: Red River (2011)",
          "uuid": "wikien-AC72JkHJ8X3ddRqmCbv11w",
          "super": [
            "Operation Flashpoint (series)",
            "Codemasters series"
          ],
          "markdown": "Main article: [Operation Flashpoint: Red River](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Flashpoint:_Red_River \"Operation Flashpoint: Red River\")\n\nThe game's plot concerns a fictional conflict in [Tajikistan](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tajikistan \"Tajikistan\"). The game follows a platoon of [Marines](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_Marine_Corps \"United States Marine Corps\"), with the player controlling Kirby, Bravo team fireteam leader.",
